{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farm, build, and explore in the not-so-appropriately named town Cozy Harvest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Harvest is a small town that used to be blooming with life. Now - not so much. Your task is to restore the land in this post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is enshrouded in thick fog and toxic radioactivity. Plants and animals have been rapidly mutating for decades. You need to wander through the gloomy woods to forage for valuable resources whilst avoiding contact with any mutated beasts that may reside there...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/18c8f0835a7e2d024c3230c58d84716e.webp?t=1762371272\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/4c84e9449cdcfb58716c4288a5b35063.poster.avif?t=1762371272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/4c84e9449cdcfb58716c4288a5b35063.webm?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/4c84e9449cdcfb58716c4288a5b35063.mp4?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/3b00943a70c0b92c81f7934907ff6d0a.webp?t=1762371272\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/b39d6a1187117260e2b98b58bd4213fe.poster.avif?t=1762371272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/b39d6a1187117260e2b98b58bd4213fe.webm?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/b39d6a1187117260e2b98b58bd4213fe.mp4?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow a unique variation of plants. </strong>The rapid mutation of plant life has created the weirdest species of plants. Learn what they do and what they are used for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a shelter.</strong>\u00a0A flexible building system allows you to build your dream house and protect yourself from the unknown creatures that roam outside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a hostile world.</strong>\u00a0The world is filled with valuable resources and secrets for you to find. You have to be careful, however, as radioactivity, toxic waste, and brutal weather has cultivated the most dangerous creatures. Even certain plants are known to attack people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a master of trades.</strong> There are five skills to master. Farming, foraging, tree felling, fishing, and mining. Leveling up increases your proficiency, allowing you to attempt more difficult tasks for better resources.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076680?t=1762371272","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076680?t=1762371272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/b7680f6c4f6834f042c63de0e06ae83cfff03c54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762371272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/b7680f6c4f6834f042c63de0e06ae83cfff03c54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762371272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some plants may look creepy or somewhat sexual. General creepy atmosphere."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farm, build, and explore in the not-so-appropriately named town Cozy Harvest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Harvest is a small town that used to be blooming with life. Now - not so much. Your task is to restore the land in this post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is enshrouded in thick fog and toxic radioactivity. Plants and animals have been rapidly mutating for decades. You need to wander through the gloomy woods to forage for valuable resources whilst avoiding contact with any mutated beasts that may reside there...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/18c8f0835a7e2d024c3230c58d84716e.webp?t=1762371272\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/4c84e9449cdcfb58716c4288a5b35063.poster.avif?t=1762371272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/4c84e9449cdcfb58716c4288a5b35063.webm?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/4c84e9449cdcfb58716c4288a5b35063.mp4?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/3b00943a70c0b92c81f7934907ff6d0a.webp?t=1762371272\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/b39d6a1187117260e2b98b58bd4213fe.poster.avif?t=1762371272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/b39d6a1187117260e2b98b58bd4213fe.webm?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/extras/b39d6a1187117260e2b98b58bd4213fe.mp4?t=1762371272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow a unique variation of plants. </strong>The rapid mutation of plant life has created the weirdest species of plants. Learn what they do and what they are used for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a shelter.</strong>\u00a0A flexible building system allows you to build your dream house and protect yourself from the unknown creatures that roam outside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a hostile world.</strong>\u00a0The world is filled with valuable resources and secrets for you to find. You have to be careful, however, as radioactivity, toxic waste, and brutal weather has cultivated the most dangerous creatures. Even certain plants are known to attack people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a master of trades.</strong> There are five skills to master. Farming, foraging, tree felling, fishing, and mining. Leveling up increases your proficiency, allowing you to attempt more difficult tasks for better resources.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Skaar Game Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076680/070b8447c4297e65d2d99b89666ee1773f3ea583/header.jpg?t=1762371272","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076680/1696222020/e70e0d834adf7643b3759907bf7e218880a5d98c/1761739642/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762371269","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076680/1696222020/e70e0d834adf7643b3759907bf7e218880a5d98c/1761739642/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762371269","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076680/1696222020/e70e0d834adf7643b3759907bf7e218880a5d98c/1761739642/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762371269","id":257224126,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224126/movie480.mp4?t=1762371269","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224126/movie_max.mp4?t=1762371269"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224126/cc341e5cb5628b1d1dabae3d5bd5e5e1b272a65c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762371269","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224126/movie480.webm?t=1762371269","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224126/movie_max.webm?t=1762371269"}}],"name":"Cozy Harvest","package_g